in line with the wall... where the drawbridge would be if it was
raised), and someone finds a way to ... manipulate the drawbridge, you
can get killed in a most nasty way.  Particularly, think of (magical)
ways in which you can destroy a door.  The drawbridge is like a very
big door with heavy chunks that can crush you.

If you are standing on the opposite side of the moat from a
drawbridge, you are safe.  It's just the moat and threshhold spaces
you have to be paranoid about.

