Striking/force bolt will blow up a drawbridge.  If you are on one of
the dangerous squares, you will either be crushed by the falling
portcullis (the big grate thing that goes up and down) [standing in
threshhold] or blown apart by an exploding drawbridge [standing over
moat].

Certain large creatures will instead fall into the moat, so you may be
ok if you can swim/fly, although I'm not sure.  If you can pass
through walls, I don't think you have to be worried, but again, not
too sure.

